lyc = "[00:01.31][color=54f3d6]今天
[00:02.20][color=54f3d6]明天
[00:03.21][color=54f3d6]期待每天
[00:05.22][color=54f3d6]不需要永远
[00:09.16][color=54f3d6]阴天
[00:10.22][color=54f3d6]晴天
[00:11.19][color=54f3d6]无论哪天
[00:13.18][color=54f3d6]好心情无限
[00:17.34][color=54f3d6]Lala lalu lula
[00:21.84][color=54f3d6]Tututu
[00:23.89][color=54f3d6]“喂 奶奶你好吗？”
[00:25.38][color=54f3d6]Lala lalu lula
[00:29.92][color=54f3d6]Tututu
[00:31.90][color=54f3d6]“注意身体噢 拜拜”
[00:34.09][color=54f3d6]I used to think it's not worth it
[00:41.97][color=54f3d6]That I just have to endure it
[00:49.88][color=54f3d6]Watch me take my steps
[00:51.27][color=54f3d6]Lalulula lalulula hun
[00:53.20][color=54f3d6]My journey may be short and sweet
[00:55.62][color=54f3d6]Lululu short and sweet
[00:57.73][color=54f3d6]Kindness leads my way
[00:59.12][color=54f3d6]Lalulula lalulula hun
[01:03.32][color=54f3d6]No detours no detours
[01:05.69][color=54f3d6]Let us not forget
[01:07.36][color=54f3d6]Lalulula lalulula hun
[01:09.15][color=54f3d6]We're invited to a lifelong party
[01:11.62][color=54f3d6]Lululu lifelong party
[01:13.22][color=54f3d6]It's rude to overstay
[01:15.58][color=54f3d6]Lalulula lalulula hun
[01:19.24][color=54f3d6]Bad manners bad manners
[01:22.19][color=54f3d6]人之初
[01:23.96][color=54f3d6]性本善
[01:25.94][color=54f3d6]性相近
[01:27.91][color=54f3d6]习相远
[01:29.90][color=54f3d6]It's alright
[01:31.89][color=54f3d6]冇问题
[01:33.89][color=54f3d6]It is time
[01:35.90][color=54f3d6]Such is life
[01:37.15][color=54f3d6]天天
[01:38.47][color=54f3d6]“喂 奶奶
[01:39.98][color=54f3d6]最近发生了一件非常有趣的事
[01:42.95][color=54f3d6]我讲给你听啊”
[01:45.17][color=54f3d6]天天
[01:46.49][color=54f3d6]“奶奶再见
[01:48.26][color=54f3d6]不过我们今后应该也不会再见了
[01:51.32][color=54f3d6]呵呵 对吧？”
[01:53.29][color=54f3d6]今天
[01:54.25][color=54f3d6]明天
[01:55.19][color=54f3d6]期待每天
[01:57.18][color=54f3d6]不需要永远
[02:01.17][color=54f3d6]阴天
[02:02.19][color=54f3d6]晴天
[02:03.18][color=54f3d6]无论哪天
[02:05.24][color=54f3d6]好心情无限
[02:10.14][color=54f3d6]I won't pretend that I don't care
[02:14.01][color=54f3d6]无限
[02:17.93][color=54f3d6]Take in the weight each moment bears
[02:21.88][color=54f3d6]无限
[02:25.90][color=54f3d6]Fresh air so crisp water so clear
[02:29.93][color=54f3d6]无限
[02:33.92][color=54f3d6]Caterpillars dream butterflies fear
[02:37.95][color=54f3d6]永远
[02:40.23][color=54f3d6]So what if we can race against the wheels of death?
[02:48.30][color=54f3d6]If we are always running we can't behold the sceneries
[02:56.27][color=54f3d6]Hoping that through my finder
[03:00.27][color=54f3d6]You'll find another answer
[03:04.31][color=54f3d6]The well inside my heart is overflowed with love
[03:13.69][color=54f3d6]Watch me take my steps
[03:15.15][color=54f3d6]Lalulula lalulula hun
[03:17.12][color=54f3d6]My journey may be short and sweet
[03:19.61][color=54f3d6]Lululu short and sweet
[03:21.70][color=54f3d6]Kindness leads my way
[03:23.16][color=54f3d6]Lalulula lalulula hun
[03:27.20][color=54f3d6]No detours no detours
[03:29.68][color=54f3d6]Someday I'll be dead
[03:31.43][color=54f3d6]Lalulula lalulula hun
[03:33.08][color=54f3d6]Don't be jealous of me resting in peace
[03:35.59][color=54f3d6]Lululu resting in peace
[03:37.71][color=54f3d6]With a smile on my face
[03:39.42][color=54f3d6]Lalulula lalulula hun
[03:43.19][color=54f3d6]Rest assured rest assured
[03:46.03][color=54f3d6]人之初
[03:47.98][color=54f3d6]性本善
[03:49.92][color=54f3d6]性相近
[03:51.95][color=54f3d6]习相远
[03:53.95][color=54f3d6]It's alright
[03:55.93][color=54f3d6]冇问题
[03:57.96][color=54f3d6]It is time
[03:59.98][color=54f3d6]Such is life"
